WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:08.980
GAINAX      20th Anniversary Production

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.020
Shh! Stop that. Not today!

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:37.600
I'm not taking you on a walk. Please stop it!

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.880
Cut it out, you dumb dog!

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.530
Never put off until tomorrow what you decide to do today...

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:51.860
Clouds inevitably follow sunshine.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.070
Master, I, Nono, am leaving.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.460
Well, live a full, long life!

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:36.510
I don't think I've ever seen a god.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.430
If a god had something to wish for...

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.000
...what would it pray to?

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:02.370
Even if you gaze up at the starry sky every night with a wish in your heart...

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:05.500
there's no telling when a falling star will come.

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:10.990
So, by saying that wishes come true if you wish upon a falling star...

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:14.600
that basically means that wishes never come true, right?

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.760
But... my wish will come true.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.140
Because, I've...

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:36.270
Because, I've been waiting for this falling star!

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:54.500
Was I so dumb I ran away from home...?

00:02:56.050 --> 00:03:02.330
The slightly salty miso soup every morning...
The winding, hilly road to the library...

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.270
The crunching sound when stepping into the first frost...

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.670
The scent of the stream...

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.580
I loved all of that, but...

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.660
I've finally made it this far.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:11.290
I, Nono, am going to become a space pilot, no matter what!

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:14.190
After all...

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.460
Episode 1: Please, Let Me Call You Onee-sama!

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:48.780
Thwarted by gravity again.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:51.740
6 hours at 720 yen an hour...

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.060
Subtract the cost of the 6 plates I split today...

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.220
That puts my earnings for one full day at... Let's see...

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.730
220 yen... total.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.510
Damn you, Newton! Unforgivable!

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:10.070
I'll catch your falling apples, so would you mind taking back that whole gravity thing?

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:14.120
For the apple, that'll be 150 yen.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:17.920
Oh, no! Now I'm down to 70 yen for today's work!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:21.260
Day after day, you split plates, you split frying pans...

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.410
Last week, you even split apart a fridge.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.930
People don't normally split fridges, you know.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.780
Splitting things is all I'm good at.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:32.040
How about going back to the country and splitting wood, then?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.640
It's not that cut and dried!

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:38.190
Nono-chan, since you're still young, you might not get it, but...

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:42.190
...I'm guessing commercial-grade refrigerators are expensive, aren't they?

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:47.400
Oh, they're expensive, all right. You'll be working off the price of that for 6 months.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.110
But that's beside the point.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:54.490
Why don't you focus more on your job instead of chasing empty fantasies?

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:59.120
You won't find anywhere else that throws in room and board.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:03.460
But... My dream is to...

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.370
HEEYY!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:11.530
Space pilot!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.010
There we go, easy does it...

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.010
There we go...

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:18.180
Gimme the usual.

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:20.360
Coming right up! Ahh!

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.870
Don't you still have some floor-scrubbing left to do?

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:24.570
Yes, ma'am...

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:34.960
C'mon, Miss. You can't make a space pilot scrub the floors like that!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.470
Quit teasing around.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.510
Nono-chan, you're still going for that?

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.780
Of course. I will be a space pilot!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.940
I've heard you've been out into space before...

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.090
Kinda, yeah.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.380
Really?!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.800
It was a school trip, though.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.470
Oh, so you were just a tourist.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.680
It's hard to impress a real space pilot, isn't it?

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.930
She's a child, you know. She'll take you seriously.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:05.060
But Captain, weren't you a cadet in the Space Force when you were younger?

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.390
You started out in gunnery, right?

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:08.300
Eh?!

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:12.090
Seriously?! I really want to be one! Please, lecture me!

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:14.250
Well, first of all...

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.340
Once you make it out of space high school or space prep school...

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:20.100
you're looking at 4 years minimum at Space Force College.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:22.750
After passing the space cadet exam...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:27.690
you have to earn 38 licenses for military space gear at a space training center...

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:31.260
which takes 6 to 7 years at least. That's where I gave up.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.940
After that, you'll need to have served over 2 years of active duty...

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:37.960
have the recommendation letter of a senior officer, and pass a final three-stage screening test.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:41.350
Once you've cleared all those hurdles, you can finally serve in the space fleet.

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.940
Though you'll spend your first year on a training vessel.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.840
It takes 15 years at least?!

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.520
It ain't worth that much work!

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:52.020
You can't just keep splitting plates.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.450
Hey, you're supposed to wax there!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.370
15 years... 15 years, that long?

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.470
My dream's a long way off.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:06.540
With all the plates I split every day, it's like I make a kind of Dream Island...

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:10.920
An island made of plates, with frying pans and fridges buried all over the place.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:13.910
Please call that island "Nono Island"!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.520
I'll bury you too.

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.370
At any rate...

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.530
It's all about hard work and guts!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:26.250
Still, she could make a nice little bride right now.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.240
No kidding.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:33.350
If you marry, your hubby'll open up that can of wax for ya!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.530
And he'll sweep you up and carry you off to bed!

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:44.860
Hey, no fair!

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.540
Keep it decent, now.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.640
Check it out, I can even do stuff like this!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:54.410
I'll bet you even those fleet guys couldn't do stuff like this so well!

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:58.680
Cut it out, please! No! Not there, anywhere but there!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.800
Please stop it!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:05.030
Here, how d'ya like this?

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:09.230
Sir, you're creating trouble for us. This will lead to an audit by the agency!

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:11.870
Senpai! Come on, senpai, let me have a turn!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:12.510
Sir? Sir!

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.470
Whee, isn't this fun!
Sir? Sir!

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:15.460
Whee, isn't this fun!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.580
P-Please, stop! Quit it, please!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.920
Don't! Stop! Not there!

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.430
Ow-ow-ow...

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:07.160
Wh... Wha... Wha... What was that?!

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:10.500
A Topless... Never seen that before.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.290
A Topless? That's one?

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.540
That customer just now. What kind of person is she?

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:20.680
A real space pilot.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:21.260
EEH?!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:24.590
Wait! Please, hold on!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.090
Please insert your ID card into the slot.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:41.070
Please insert your ID card into the slot.
Onee-sama!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.390
Onee-sama!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:55.650
I've finally managed to catch up with you!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.430
Ah, the girl from before.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:02.580
Thank you so much for saving me! I, Nono, was so moved!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:04.760
Just the spirit of cooperation.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:09.500
Yes! That's true. You're so great, Onee-sama!

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:14.180
If you're ever in trouble, Onee-sama,
I, Nono will be sure to help you out!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.300
Who's "Onee-sama"?

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:17.360
I just know I will!

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:19.680
Is that so.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:24.090
Onee-sama, you're a space pilot, right?

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:25.170
What?

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.580
A space pilot!

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:29.580
You don't recognize this uniform?

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:32.590
It's so cool! And moe-moe, too!

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:36.090
It's the Fraternity's space monster interception squad.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.340
Space monster?

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.800
Awesome! I'm fired up! I'm totally on fire!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.000
Why do I have to be "Onee-sama"?

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:48.600
That's a righteous organization that fights against the space monsters, right?

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.140
Heroes of justice that protect the people, right?

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:54.560
Pretty much.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.850
I, Nono, want to be one, too!

00:11:56.850 --> 00:12:00.650
I want to become a space pilot like you and protect the people!

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.120
That's because...!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:08.000
That's because I want to be like Nono-Riri!!!

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.020
Oh, Nono-Riri is someone who...

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:13.820
I've got no idea who that is, but...

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:17.530
Eh?

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:21.610
...it split.

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:24.120
I've split something again.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.380
Too bad. You can't do it.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.880
I'll do my best with hard work and guts!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.350
I don't need that stuff.

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:37.350
The only people who can fight together are those who were acknowledged as Topless.

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.660
Topless?

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.180
Oh, no...

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:34.650
Hey, Princess...

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:36.680
Princess Lal'C.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:42.080
How's it feel to be back in the lower world after so long?

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:45.080
Like I drew the short straw.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:51.370
It's cold, the air's all thin, it smells all funky...

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.360
and there are no sea birds at all!

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.450
There's no way you'll find one there.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:14:01.430
I know that. Plus, what we're looking for may not have ever been here.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:04.880
The prediction this time is from the Serpentine twins.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:10.040
Their accuracy's been dropping lately...

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:14.920
Ooh, you went there! But I've predicted it, too.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:16.730
When?!

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.420
Don't yell!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.420
Besides that, the Navigational Safety Bureau just issued a report...

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.960
confirming that they've sighted suspicious meteorites.

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:28.660
A space monster has got to be there.

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:36.870
Lucky you! Now you'll be a shoo-in for the top kill count again this month, Princess.

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:42.190
Geez... There's no holding a candle to the Curve Wrecker.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.610
They haven't even sounded the evacuation alarm!

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:47.230
Hey, Tycho? Tycho!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:56.150
Vectoring field 9, minus 1...

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.030
Nono-chan? What about the diner?

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:00.900
Aah!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.610
Mama got worried and drove out looking for you.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:08.680
Sorry about before, I didn't mean anything by it.

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:12.780
C'mon, forgive me! C'mon, please?

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:14.740
Captain!

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:20.520
Isn't this the thing they just notified us about? Captain?

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:25.970
Man, don't you ever grow up, old men...?

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:29.180
I'll tell your wife on you!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.200
Captain? I'm scared...

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:42.870
Whoa!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:43.200
Huh?!

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.320
What the hell?!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:47.220
Hey, it's coming this way!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:04.670
Ma... Ma... Ma... A Martian?!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:05.720
Impossible!

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.730
I'm gonna try to capture it. Back me up!

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.820
Surround it from both sides. Let's move!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.030
Captain!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:16.650
It's airborne!

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:21.370
HEY! Dammit!!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.580
What the hell is this thing?!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:42.920
Keep down!

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:51.020
You're not injured, right? Good.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:52.640
Yes, Onee-sama!

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:55.060
What?

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.370
Nothing...

00:16:56.680 --> 00:17:01.380
It's that Topless from earlier... This thing... A space monster?!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.390
I haven't seen this type before. A new species, maybe?

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:07.920
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>! Come!!

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:15.580
A Buster Machine!

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:21.840
That's it?

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:39.400
Buster Machine · <i>Dix-Neuf</i>

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.900
It's an enemy space monster. Dispose of it!

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.050
Ow! Hot-hot-hot!

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:14.420
Just handle a simple interdiction on your own!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.850
Forget it! I'll take it from here!

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.810
You too, hurry up and get out of here.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:23.440
Onee-sama!

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:24.720
You'll get in the way!

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:46.770
Let's go, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>. Activate physical canceler.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.830
Exotic Maneuver!

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.730
Incredible... Is that the ether sparkling?

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:04.900
That's...

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.130
The power of a Topless...

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:13.290
Onee-sama, you're so cool!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:57.410
Nono-chan! Hey, over here!

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.040
Manager!

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:04.710
Nono-chan!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:19.850
Manager?!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.630
Manager!!

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:24.420
Nono! Stay back!

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.270
I'll get you out of there right away!

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:29.960
No, you idiot! Hurry up and get out of here!

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:30.440
Ouch!

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:37.400
What is she doing? I told her she was in the way!

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.870
Forget it, Nono. You won't budge it!

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.670
No! Nono-Riri would never give up!

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:52.590
Try to be realistic here! There are things in this world that you just can't do!

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:55.800
The space monster is waking up. Give it up!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:58.810
I'll save her, no matter what!

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:02.740
I'll save her! And then... I'll go out into space!

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:06.950
Because, Nono-Riri would...

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:33.520
No, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>! Don't let it get away!

00:22:31.020 --> 00:22:34.570
4th Planet in the Sol System

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:38.780
Mars

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:50.270
Buster...

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:54.380
GAITER!!!

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:02.240
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>! What are you doing?!

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>! Why did you hesitate?!

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:25.030
She's... alive?

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:36.720
Onee-sama is...!

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:00.820
Lightning...

00:24:01.360 --> 00:24:05.290
KICK!!!

00:24:10.710 --> 00:24:11.910
It broke?!

00:24:12.980 --> 00:24:14.100
I know!

00:24:14.650 --> 00:24:15.960
Buster...

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:21.290
BEAM!!!

00:24:35.440 --> 00:24:39.440
Onee-sama! I did it!

00:24:42.950 --> 00:24:46.470
I, Nono, became Topless too!

00:24:48.140 --> 00:24:50.870
What on Earth is this girl?

00:24:55.330 --> 00:25:00.210
To Be Continued

00:25:00.420 --> 00:25:07.610
Crying, laughing, I can never tell
naitari warattari itsumo wakaranai

00:25:09.270 --> 00:25:13.430
People are mysterious creatures
hito wa fushigi na ikimono

00:25:13.430 --> 00:25:17.860
Getting upset over being lonely
sabishii noni okotteru

00:25:17.860 --> 00:25:21.020
Getting upset over being happy
ureshii noni okotteru

00:25:22.040 --> 00:25:27.910
Getting lost even when they put on airs
kidottemo mayotte iru no

00:25:27.910 --> 00:25:30.510
Why is it?
doushite na no?

00:25:30.910 --> 00:25:34.600
No matter how many times you stumble
nando tsumazuichattemo

00:25:34.600 --> 00:25:39.710
Stand back up, smile, and face forward
tachiagatte sou waratte mae muite

00:25:39.710 --> 00:25:47.010
Surely when tomorrow comes, you will be a bit different
kitto ashita ni nattara sukoshi kawatte irareru

00:25:47.710 --> 00:25:51.410
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:26:10.280 --> 00:26:13.870
May this feeling reach that person...
douka konna omoi ga

00:26:13.870 --> 00:26:18.530
And the world, and the universe
ano hito ni sekai ni uchuu ni made

00:26:18.530 --> 00:26:26.270
Another one spills down
todokimasu you ni tomata hitotsu koboreochiru

00:26:27.000 --> 00:26:36.120
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:26:46.160 --> 00:26:49.160
Next Episode Preview

00:26:49.160 --> 00:26:52.760
Nono and Onee-sama, the Topless duo that saved Mars from a disaster!

00:26:52.760 --> 00:26:56.410
And yet, we're arrested by the Space Force and thrown into handcuffs?!

00:26:56.410 --> 00:26:59.880
